# The images are built from the source tree; everything below is either rebuilt
# inside the image, irrelevant to it, or must never reach it. Without this file
# the build context is ~2.6 GB (the local .venv alone is most of it) — slow for
# a local `docker build`, and slow AND billable for a remote builder or a CI
# runner. Dockerfile.agent copies only pyproject/uv.lock/src/adk_release_agent.
.venv/
.git/
node_modules/
backstage/
deployment-repo/
traces/
.claude/
.codex/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.env
.DS_Store
# Tests, design notes, docs and deploy manifests are not part of the runtime image.
tests/
evals/
design/
practice/
docs/
examples/
k8s/
helm/
